---
title: Copper kettle porridge
servings: 2 to 3
tags:
  - breakfast
---

Tip @steel cut oats{2/3%cup} into a #small pot{} with @milk{1 1/2%cups} and @water{1%cup}.

Bring to a gentle boil, then simmer for ~{20 to 25%minutes}, stirring now and then.

Sweeten with @maple syrup{1 to 2%tbsp} and top with @toasted walnuts{2%tbsp}(roughly chopped) and @blueberries{a handful}.
